#descr "Veterans of the unending Blood War, Nycaloths were the elite air cavalry in yugoloth armies, swooping down onto enemy flanks and tearing up unsuspecting troops. They were the lowest of the greater yugoloths and bitterly resented it, constantly scheming to ascend to greater status and prestige. Although they were loyal, powerful, intelligent, and mercenary enough to work with practically anyone, their constant scheming made their alliances often brief. Night Hags were particularly avoidant of Nycoloths. 

